┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                  🎵  local-takkie   Kitchen   channel 2   port 5000   192.168.1.2                 │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
┌👥  Peers (2 on you┌❓  Keys (any key closes)────────────────────────────────────┐──────────────────┐
│● Bedroom         │ SPACE    talk (hold or toggle, see the footer)             │                  │
│○ 0000000000000003│ T        switch between hold and toggle                    │                  │
│○ Office          │ M        mute or unmute what you hear                      │                  │
│                  │ + / -    volume up or down                                 │                  │
│                  │ ↑ / ↓    pick someone in the peer list                     │                  │
│                  │ X        mute or unmute the picked person                  │                  │
│                  │ B        beeps on or off (when talk starts and ends)       │                  │
└──────────────────│ N        noise removal: off, normal or strong              │                  │
┌🎤  Push-to-Talk (S│ L        even out a quiet or loud voice, on or off         │                  │
│                🟡 │ C        clarity lift: off, normal or strong               │                  │
└──────────────────│ R        don't play people in the same room, on or off     │                  │
┌🔊  Levels─────────│ D        show the microphone and speaker in use            │                  │
│Mic      ░░░░░░░░░│ 1-9, 0   switch to channel 1 to 10                         │                  │
│Speaker  █████████│ P        set or clear this channel's passphrase            │                  │
│Buffer  48 ms    V│ ?        this help                                         │                  │
│Noise   normal    │ Q / Esc  quit                                              │                  │
└──────────────────└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘──────────────────┘
